==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~13.33 seconds<sup>90f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 86.67~106.67 seconds<sup>2,600f~3,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 86.67~106.67 seconds<sup>2,600f~3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The units that are highly recommended for this stage are [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], or even [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Luxury Bath Cat]] since they all outrange Sleipnir. If you have any other cats that can outrange him, you can use them as well.

